{"src":"ro","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":208100,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"ro","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":9333.590289,"text":"Dar, după ce a pierdut avantajul capitanului, India a făcut doar 36 de curse, pierdând 7 porți până la finalul repreziei."},{"kind":"text","t":10094.369612999999,"text":"But after losing the captain's advantage, India scored only 36 runs, losing 7 wickets by the end of their innings."},{"kind":"audio","t":10144.266835,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10145.956538999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":10147.139443,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10148.575362,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10151.546521,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10153.294297,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10153.906559,"samples":22392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":17638.232885999998,"text":"De obicei, au oferit o specială de mâncare, băutură și divertisment pentru a păstra buna dispoziție și oaspeții să rămână în local."},{"kind":"text","t":18216.431092,"text":"Usually they offered special food, drinks, and entertainment to keep the mood high and the guests staying around."},{"kind":"audio","t":18261.474497,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18263.62253,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18264.835445,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":18266.477798,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":18268.09419,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":140,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18268.964668,"samples":22160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":27510.234712,"text":"Del Potro a avut primul avantaj în setul secund, dar și acesta a necesitat un tie-break după ce s-a ajuns la 6-6."},{"kind":"text","t":28205.552950999998,"text":"Del Potro took the first lead in the second set, but it also required a tie-break after it reached 6-6."},{"kind":"audio","t":28252.118666,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":28253.475202999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":28254.966852999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":28256.626087,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":28258.232119,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":28258.79305,"samples":16760,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":150},{"kind":"input","t":34725.742469000004,"text":"Internetul combina elemente de comunicație în masă și interpersonală."},{"kind":"text","t":35032.58358300001,"text":"The Internet combines elements of mass and interpersonal communication."},{"kind":"audio","t":35073.506415,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35075.140498,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35076.71201,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":35078.343403000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":860},{"kind":"audio","t":35078.460795000006,"samples":2728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":49223.81469100001,"text":"Compoziția acestor cristale se potrivește cu acelor întâlnite în urina animalelor de companie afectate atunci când sunt comparate printr-o spectroscopie în infraroșu, spectroscopie în IMS."},{"kind":"text","t":49980.164786,"text":"The composition of these crystals matches those found in the urine of affected pets when compared using infrared spectroscopy and IMS spectroscopy."},{"kind":"audio","t":50031.520267,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50032.870715000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50034.489697000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50036.080219,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":50037.952897,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50039.45058700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50040.967517000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50042.703362,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":50042.872296,"samples":7856,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":57795.151986000004,"text":"Pe unele rute, companiile mai mari dețin propriile avioane, dar alte rute și companiile mai mici aveau o problemă."},{"kind":"text","t":58398.26158200001,"text":"On some routes, the larger companies have their own aircraft, but other routes and smaller companies had a problem."},{"kind":"audio","t":58443.70258500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":58445.391179000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58446.998522,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":58448.554913,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58450.259717,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58451.152545000004,"samples":24560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":400},{"kind":"input","t":66707.701356,"text":"Unii atomi au nuclee instabile, ceea ce înseamnă că țin să se descompună cu un impuls mic sau fără impuls."},{"kind":"text","t":67239.751845,"text":"Some atoms have unstable nuclei, which means that they tend to decay with little or no momentum."},{"kind":"audio","t":67284.46230300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67285.81658,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":67287.430633,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":510,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67289.111327,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67290.77897,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":67290.985304,"samples":10160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":77752.205187,"text":"În cursul aceleiași luni, un alt avion a ieșit de pistă în Mașad, lovind un zid, ceea ce a adus la decesul a 17 persoane."},{"kind":"text","t":78511.10875300001,"text":"During the same month, another plane went off the runway in Mashhad, hitting a wall, resulting in the death of 17 people."},{"kind":"audio","t":78557.923293,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78559.34214200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78561.006825,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78562.602627,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78564.260291,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78565.87659300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78566.628428,"samples":19992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":200},{"kind":"input","t":85352.23654900001,"text":"Acestea sunt aproape toate plaje nisipoase, unde se poate nota in siguranta."},{"kind":"text","t":85743.610082,"text":"These are almost all sandy beaches, where you can swim safely."},{"kind":"audio","t":85784.306129,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85785.565914,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":85787.21118700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85787.795859,"samples":16896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":100},{"kind":"input","t":90541.447048,"text":"iar majoritatea au parte de umbră de la copacii Pohutu Kava."},{"kind":"text","t":90948.276432,"text":"And most of them are shaded by the Pohutu Kava trees."},{"kind":"audio","t":90987.308306,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":90988.765725,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90990.400588,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":90990.56444100001,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":100383.89366,"text":"Printre sporturile populare se numără fotbalul, basketul, voleiul, polona, apă, scrima, rugbyul,"},{"kind":"text","t":100948.31052900001,"text":"Popular sports include football, basketball, volleyball, polo, water sports, fencing, and rugby."},{"kind":"audio","t":100992.63927,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100993.950306,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100995.56793800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100997.20349100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100998.840734,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":100999.101939,"samples":11360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":105456.35675400001,"text":"ciclismul, hocheiul pe gheață, hocheiul pe role și cursele de Formula 1."},{"kind":"text","t":105851.494342,"text":"cycling, ice hockey, roller hockey and Formula 1 racing."},{"kind":"audio","t":105890.364183,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105891.986206,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":105893.587228,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105894.11820900001,"samples":16896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":100},{"kind":"input","t":112143.81873300001,"text":"În climatul cald din Orientul Mijlociu, casa era mai puțin importantă."},{"kind":"text","t":112544.63235500001,"text":"In the hot climate of the Middle East, the house was less important."},{"kind":"audio","t":112586.02777700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":112587.345164,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":112588.953356,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":112589.316143,"samples":13296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":119931.554477,"text":"Arhiteclul este situat la 120 km spre nordul peniziului."},{"kind":"text","t":120328.026021,"text":"The architect is located 120 km north of the peninsula."},{"kind":"audio","t":120369.576246,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120371.167048,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120372.82804200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120374.22406000001,"samples":31296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":660},{"kind":"input","t":125424.512438,"text":"Cea mai mare este insula King George cu asezarea Villa Las Estrellas."},{"kind":"text","t":125850.379334,"text":"The largest is King George Island, with the settlement of Villa Las Estrellas."},{"kind":"audio","t":125881.704373,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125883.013169,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":125884.611581,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125886.279355,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":125886.419838,"samples":8728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":133515.386111,"text":"Sucul de varză își schimbă culoarea în funcție cât de acidă sau de bazică, alcalină și substanța chimică."},{"kind":"text","t":134051.699126,"text":"Cabbage juice changes its color depending on how acidic or basic, alkaline and chemical it is."},{"kind":"audio","t":134095.12632799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":134096.830082,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":134098.462485,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":134100.009726,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":134101.746601,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":134101.88438399998,"samples":6560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":143821.908555,"text":"Podul este programat a fi pe deplin funcțional în septembrie 2017, când punctele de control VAMAL brazilene se așteaptă să fie terminate."},{"kind":"text","t":144596.94259599998,"text":"The bridge is scheduled to be fully operational in September 2017, when the Brazilian VAMAL checkpoints are expected to be completed."},{"kind":"audio","t":144648.124744,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144649.550283,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144651.164485,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144652.757207,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":880},{"kind":"audio","t":144654.372159,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144656.030313,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144657.667506,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144658.77012799997,"samples":25024,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":149647.091021,"text":"Umiditatea prezentă pe mâini va reacționa cu straturile exterioare."},{"kind":"text","t":150037.56681599998,"text":"The moisture present on the hands will react with the outer layers."},{"kind":"audio","t":150066.21562099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":150067.867115,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":150069.779793,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":150070.11073,"samples":16896,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":150},{"kind":"input","t":154852.17968,"text":"ceea ce vă poate da o senzație ciudată și duce la formarea unui fel de crustă."},{"kind":"text","t":155340.08873199997,"text":"which can give you a strange feeling and lead to the formation of a kind of crust."},{"kind":"audio","t":155382.569575,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":155383.900152,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155385.52408499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":155387.15953799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":800},{"kind":"audio","t":155387.339831,"samples":1528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":162148.105373,"text":"Una dintre bombe a explodat în fața biroului governatorului general."},{"kind":"text","t":162551.08504799998,"text":"One of the bombs exploded in front of the Governor General's office."},{"kind":"audio","t":162592.314307,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162593.72537499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162595.334637,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":162595.93463899998,"samples":17496,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":170},{"kind":"input","t":173524.680994,"text":"Sultanul marocan a reconstruit orașul sub numele de Daru-i-badia, iar numele de Casablanca a fost dat de către negustorii spanioli."},{"kind":"text","t":174266.04185799998,"text":"The Moroccan Sultan rebuilt the city under the name Daru-i-badia, and the name Casablanca was given by Spanish merchants."},{"kind":"audio","t":174315.551312,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174316.88204899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174318.496892,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174320.15106499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174321.80689799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174323.436181,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":174324.062013,"samples":17592,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":210},{"kind":"input","t":177392.395875,"text":"care stabiliseră acolo baze comerciale."},{"kind":"text","t":177592.330732,"text":"who had established trading bases there."},{"kind":"audio","t":177631.170942,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177633.13752199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":177633.305435,"samples":6464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":189300.820521,"text":"A fost întâmpinat de viceprim ministrul Singaporeului, Wong Kang-Seng, și a purtat discuții cu privire la comerț și terorism cu primul ministru al Singaporeului,"},{"kind":"text","t":190180.704138,"text":"He was welcomed by Singapore’s Deputy Prime Minister, Wong Kang-Seng, and held talks on trade and terrorism with Singapore’s Prime Minister, Lee Hsien Loong."},{"kind":"audio","t":190232.458418,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":190233.835485,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":190235.365696,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":190236.965848,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":190238.65798199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":190240.571061,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":190241.844696,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":190243.463019,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":190243.698473,"samples":10856,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":200807.765892,"text":"Bomba de fisiune funcționează conform principiului că este nevoie de energie pentru a asambla un nucleu cu mulți protoni și neutroni."},{"kind":"text","t":201445.348611,"text":"The fission bomb works according to the principle that energy is needed to assemble a nucleus with many protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"audio","t":201484.61304,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201486.162201,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201487.660151,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201489.295614,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201490.856205,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201492.71539199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":201493.064979,"samples":16992,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":120},{"kind":"input","t":207136.861351,"text":"În arhipelaguri și lacuri nu aveți neapărat nevoie de un iaht."},{"kind":"text","t":207539.184364,"text":"In archipelagos and lakes you don’t necessarily need a yacht."},{"kind":"audio","t":207580.91639199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":207582.207948,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":207583.856411,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":207584.354221,"samples":15096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":218204.78141199998,"code":1005}]}